      "version": "0.1.0-beta.9",
      "notes": "# DevClash 0.1.0-beta.9\n\nShare your AI usage and actual public rank directly from the desktop app.\n\n- Open an in-app Share composer with Usage and Rank cards, selected periods, and optional token, provider and cost details.\n- Choose Simple, Community or Challenge captions, then edit the text before sharing.\n- Use rounded whole-number token labels, space for up to four providers, and a compact estimated-cost label beside its amount.\n- Copy the card and open an X draft with the caption. Paste the copied image into X and review before posting; nothing is published automatically.\n- Save the same card as a PNG or copy its text separately.\n- Export local usage diagnostics for duplicate investigations without prompts or credentials.\n- Isolate QA credentials from the production Keychain and retain the normal app signing identity for update continuity.\n\nThis remains a beta. Package verification and device checks are recorded separately from publication. Existing beta.8 installers remain unchanged.\n\nBuilt locally on native hosts. Source commit: 357281dda7ebaa307e01bb175328c2819ee01384.\n",
